  "description": "Diagnostics and benchmarking CLI for SIP and WebRTC, built on the SIPSorcery library: OPTIONS pings, test calls, registration and load, STUN/TURN/ICE connectivity probes, WHEP/WHIP and echo-test peers, and video pipeline benchmarks. Probe/test tooling (not a general softphone); human and agent friendly with JSON output and meaningful exit codes. For routing streams and the Cloudflare/LiveKit/OpenAI fabric verbs see the SIPSorcery.Cli tool.",
